`the readings of the regime with a mixed system refused` MEANS
    `Readings of the regime of section 63(a)` WITH
        `how a system with several refrigerants is classified` IS `the text is taken not to say which paragraph governs a system with refrigerants of both kinds`
        `how a listed refrigerant whose use is not permitted is classified` IS `such a refrigerant is not as stated in paragraph (1), so paragraph (2) governs`

@ref s.63(a)(1) (src:461-462); s.63(a)(2) (src:463)
GIVETH A `Readings of the regime of section 63(a)`
`the readings of the regime with a listed refrigerant of unlawful use refused` MEANS
    `Readings of the regime of section 63(a)` WITH
        `how a system with several refrigerants is classified` IS `paragraph (1) governs a system if any of its refrigerants is as stated in it`
        `how a listed refrigerant whose use is not permitted is classified` IS `the text is taken not to say which paragraph governs such a refrigerant`
